# Plans content conventions

## Purpose

- Implementation scope, steps, **acceptance criteria**
- PDCA Plan / Act log
- Cursor Plan mode workspace target

**Deliberation** → `docs/design/*.deliberation.md`  
**Spec body** → `docs/design/*.md`

## Frontmatter

```yaml
---
title: ...
kind: plan
status: draft | agreed | superseded
scope_level: product | element | system | framework | program | algorithm
pdca_class: S0 | S1
pdca_eligible: true | false
related_design: docs/design/...
related_requirements: docs/requirements/<slug>/要件.md
unit_scope: docs/design/programs/<slug>.md   # optional · H4/H5 unit（AI-DLC Unit / s-02）
parent_hierarchy: { product, element, system, framework }
promoted_from: optional
---
```

- **PDCA Do** 既定: `programs/`, `algorithms/` only with `pdca_eligible: true`
- H0–H2 plans: `pdca_eligible: false` required
- S1: ≤5 acceptance criteria recommended（≈ 1 Bolt · `s-02`）

## Unit 完走（AI-DLC Unit · s-02/s-03）

- **unit** = `unit_scope`（H4 program または H5 algorithm の `related_design`）
- **bolt** = 本 plan 1 件（S1 · `pdca_class: S1`）
- **unit 完了** = 同一 `unit_scope` 配下の plan がすべて `done` または `superseded`（`draft`/`agreed` の open がゼロ）
- 中途離脱 → plan 分割 · `superseded` · P3 巻き戻し（`PROJECT_LIFECYCLE.md`）

## Sections

Goal, Scope hierarchy table, Scope, Acceptance criteria, Agent recommendations, User thinking (`>`), Dependencies, Facts / Assumptions / Open, Progress assessments, PDCA log

## Index

Update `.agents/plans/README.md` on create or rename.
